Copyright 2026 Stephane Fourdrinier

This product is an independent reconstruction of the method described in:
  "GlucoFM: A Dual-Stream Foundation Model for Continuous Glucose Monitoring",
  arXiv:2605.30865v2.

It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or derived from any Google implementation
or checkpoint. No official GlucoFM source code or weights were available at the
evidence cutoff of 2026-08-27. The method was reimplemented from the publication.

